        {
          "label": "Customer Comments",
          "value": "I spoke with him several times, and I believe he gave me a lot of incorrect info. He told me he is a supervisor, and I don't believe he is. He told me I am not allowed to make a will-call reservation if I have a pet. I have previously made a reservation with my cat in a carrier and did not have an issue. He also told me they could not pick me up through the back side of my house. They could not drive the vehicle to the front of my house since I live in a townhouse. He told me he contacted Userv to pick me up and they never picked me up. Another driver showed up that was supposed to pick me up 3hours."
